{
    "title": "PriceTravel: Hotels & Flights",
    "description": "Organize your vacation easily with PriceTravel, the most comprehensive travel app in Mexico. Find exclusive discounts on hotels, flights, and travel packages that combine hotel and airfare for your favorite destinations. Enjoy a faster, intuitive interface designed to provide you with the best booking experience.\r\n\r\nMain features:\r\n\u2022 Book now, pay later: Plan without worrying about immediate payment.\r\n\u2022 Interest-free months: Make your payments easier with flexible financing options.\r\n\u2022 Free cancellation: Cancel at no cost at thousands of hotels worldwide.\r\n\u2022 New look and intuitive design: Navigate quickly and easily to find your next destination.\r\n\u2022 Customized filters: Find flights and hotels that fit your budget and needs with filters for price, category, location, and more.\r\n\u2022 Detailed galleries and descriptions: Explore images and complete details of hotels and their rooms.\r\n\u2022 Secure booking: Pay quickly and securely from the app with total confidence.\r\n\u2022 Your itinerary always handy: Keep your itinerary and travel details at your fingertips.\r\n\u2022 Travel packages (Hotel + Flight): Save by booking complete packages that include both flight and hotel for maximum enjoyment.\r\n\r\nDownload PriceTravel now and access exclusive offers on flights, hotels, and travel packages. Plan your vacations, weekend getaways, or business trips easily and enjoy the best rates at all your destinations.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Organize your vacation easily with PriceTravel, the most comprehensive travel app in Mexico. Find exclusive discounts on hotels, flights, and travel packages that combine hotel and airfare for your favorite destinations. Enjoy a faster, intuitive interface designed to provide you with the best booking experience.<br><br>Main features:<br>\u2022 Book now, pay later: Plan without worrying about immediate payment.<br>\u2022 Interest-free months: Make your payments easier with flexible financing options.<br>\u2022 Free cancellation: Cancel at no cost at thousands of hotels worldwide.<br>\u2022 New look and intuitive design: Navigate quickly and easily to find your next destination.<br>\u2022 Customized filters: Find flights and hotels that fit your budget and needs with filters for price, category, location, and more.<br>\u2022 Detailed galleries and descriptions: Explore images and complete details of hotels and their rooms.<br>\u2022 Secure booking: Pay quickly and securely from the app with total confidence.<br>\u2022 Your itinerary always handy: Keep your itinerary and travel details at your fingertips.<br>\u2022 Travel packages (Hotel + Flight): Save by booking complete packages that include both flight and hotel for maximum enjoyment.<br><br>Download PriceTravel now and access exclusive offers on flights, hotels, and travel packages. Plan your vacations, weekend getaways, or business trips easily and enjoy the best rates at all your destinations.",
